  "notes": "13 CSS custom properties, e.g. --teal-0, --teal-1, --teal-2, --teal-3.\n\nUse: npm i open-props, then @import \"open-props/teal\" (or copy the variables).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/argyleink/open-props/blob/main/src/props.teal.css",
  "code": "<style>\n:where(html) {\n  --teal-0: #e6fcf5;\n  --teal-1: #c3fae8;\n  --teal-2: #96f2d7;\n  --teal-3: #63e6be;\n  --teal-4: #38d9a9;\n  --teal-5: #20c997;\n  --teal-6: #12b886;\n  --teal-7: #0ca678;\n  --teal-8: #099268;\n  --teal-9: #087f5b;\n  --teal-10: #066649;\n  --teal-11: #054d37;\n  --teal-12: #033325;\n}\n.scale { font: 12px system-ui, sans-serif; width: min(720px, 100%); }\n.scale p { margin: 12px 0 4px; color: #555; }\n.scale .row { display: grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }\n.scale .row div { height: 48px; border-radius: 6px; display: flex; align-items: end; padding: 4px; }\n.scale span { font-size: 10px; background: #fff9; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0 3px; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"scale\"><strong>Open Props teal</strong>\n<p>teal</p><div class=\"row\"><div style=\"background:#e6fcf5\" title=\"--teal-0: #e6fcf5\"><span>0</span></div><div style=\"background:#c3fae8\" title=\"--teal-1: #c3fae8\"><span>1</span></div><div style=\"background:#96f2d7\" title=\"--teal-2: #96f2d7\"><span>2</span></div><div style=\"background:#63e6be\" title=\"--teal-3: #63e6be\"><span>3</span></div><div style=\"background:#38d9a9\" title=\"--teal-4: #38d9a9\"><span>4</span></div><div style=\"background:#20c997\" title=\"--teal-5: #20c997\"><span>5</span></div><div style=\"background:#12b886\" title=\"--teal-6: #12b886\"><span>6</span></div><div style=\"background:#0ca678\" title=\"--teal-7: #0ca678\"><span>7</span></div><div style=\"background:#099268\" title=\"--teal-8: #099268\"><span>8</span></div><div style=\"background:#087f5b\" title=\"--teal-9: #087f5b\"><span>9</span></div><div style=\"background:#066649\" title=\"--teal-10: #066649\"><span>10</span></div><div style=\"background:#054d37\" title=\"--teal-11: #054d37\"><span>11</span></div><div style=\"background:#033325\" title=\"--teal-12: #033325\"><span>12</span></div></div>\n</div>",
